>         // PackageManager → null → Constructor.newInstance NPE →
>         // StartupException → Kotpref "has not been initialized" ×34
>         // uncaught. make_stable_class_token mints (or reuses) the REAL
>         // per-descriptor heap token ("Ljava/lang/Class;" +
>         // __referent_desc, F-069/F-249 law) so ref_id IS a valid heap id.
>         return_val = make_stable_class_token(want_desc);
